From 0b01c248a3deb37ce8bcb42b023051f089869fa9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 14:38:01 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Fix auto-saves lost or stuck in the pending saves when the
 page is left early

- content sent on unload from a tab being closed is received without
  sender.tab: saveContent() threw, the page was not saved and its task
  stayed in the pending saves forever
- Firefox can terminate the unload listener when a tab is closed: with
  "auto-save after page load or on page unload", snapshots of the page are
  now sent while it is waiting to be saved, and the last one is saved by
  the background script when the page goes away unsaved
- task ids started at 0, which was treated as "no task": the first
  auto-save of a session never left the pending saves
- auto-save tasks whose page is gone are now removed from the pending saves
- the options of an unloaded page are those of its URL, not of the page
  that replaced it in the tab
---
 src/core/bg/autosave.js               | 141 ++++++++++++++++++++++++--
 src/core/bg/business.js               |  62 ++++++++++-
 src/core/bg/tabs.js                   |   2 +-
 src/core/content/content-bootstrap.js |  96 +++++++++++++++++-
 4 files changed, 282 insertions(+), 19 deletions(-)

